{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"4508570","name":"真理谭：黑暗城堡的女巫","title":"真理谭：黑暗城堡的女巫","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/b3ece2903b164576d7e0a8a903f06b94.poster.avif?t=1790830287\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/b3ece2903b164576d7e0a8a903f06b94.webm?t=1790830287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/b3ece2903b164576d7e0a8a903f06b94.mp4?t=1790830287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>《真理谭：黑暗城堡的女巫》是一款掷骰定命运的黑暗奇幻RPG，灵感源自单人跑团。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这里没有队友，也没有游戏主持人（GM）——做什么由你决定，骰子由你来掷，后果也由你承担。暗黑城会记住你做过的一切，世界的进程将随你的选择而改变。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>曾经，有一位被称为英雄的魔女 。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >童话中传颂的魔女英格褒（Ingeborg）受邀成为王都埃利辛的宫廷魔术师，万民欢腾。然而随着瘟疫蔓延 ，黑暗的流言四起：“魔女是毁灭国家的恶鬼 。”如今，两位旅人正前往那座城市，你将选择其中一人踏上冒险。男战士正是由那位魔女亲手养大；女魔法师失去了记忆，正在寻找应魔女之召后下落不明的恩师。两人的道路，都通向黑暗城堡。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/2bd1079b3ee27cfbbbd503f6f84381a2.poster.avif?t=1790830287\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/2bd1079b3ee27cfbbbd503f6f84381a2.webm?t=1790830287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/2bd1079b3ee27cfbbbd503f6f84381a2.mp4?t=1790830287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>可战，可谈，也可视而不见。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你可以拔剑硬闯，可以凭口才脱身，也可以视而不见、继续赶路。如何在这个世界立身行事，由你决定；冒险是坎坷还是平顺，同样取决于你的选择。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >战斗采用回合制，节奏明快，机制刻意保持简洁。本作不以复杂的构筑和数值养成为重点，重要的是判断力和胆识，还有能不能得到幸运女神的眷顾。 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>每个选择都有相应的代价。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你要去的是正常人绝不会踏足的险地。一次误判就可能攸关性命，一次掷骰就足以让你死的轻如鸿毛 。但死亡绝不是惩罚——它只是黑暗城堡对粗心旅人的一贯回应。谨慎者三思而后行，胆大者亦应勤存档。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >行囊很小，路途很长。带上什么、舍弃什么——这也是你必须做出的重要判断。在冒险的尽头迎接你的，是你做过的、没做的一切交织而出的结局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在这部作品中，一段旅程结束后，你可以以另一位旅人的身份重走冒险之路。从另一侧看向这个相同的故事时，某些未曾看见的真相也将浮出水面 。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/1847e1af83fde677a671ab79cb21af16.poster.avif?t=1790830287\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/1847e1af83fde677a671ab79cb21af16.webm?t=1790830287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/1847e1af83fde677a671ab79cb21af16.mp4?t=1790830287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>每一张插画，都出自同一人之手。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >西村芳雄（Nishimura Yoshio）是一位从业30年的游戏行业老将。在卡普空，他作为首席背景美术参与了初代《怪物猎人》；在香草社（Vanillaware），他参与制作了《奥丁领域》《魔龙宝冠》《十三机兵防卫圈》。此后他移居日本乡间的小山村，至今仍耕种田地——并用6年的时间和心血完成了这款游戏。作品中300余张插画均由他亲手绘制，任何环节都未使用生成式AI。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>音乐：崎元仁。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >配乐由崎元仁及其工作室Basiscape创作（代表作：《最终幻想战略版》《放浪冒险谭》《十三机兵防卫圈》）。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>其他特点</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >文本量：150,000词以上（统计自英文版）</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >单周目时长：6–8小时</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >全收集（两位旅人、全结局、全隐藏要素）：约10小时</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游玩风格：战斗、交涉、回避——所有风格皆可通关</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >致敬作品：《圣杯任务》（Grailquest）、《魔法巫术》（Sorcery!）、《战斗幻想》（Fighting Fantasy）</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>直播与视频政策</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >欢迎一切形式的实况、直播与视频创作。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无论个人还是公司，均可进行商业化。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如能在简介栏中附上商店页面链接，我们将不胜感激。</p></li></ul>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/7f4d25988802019907244ae7f5d09b208c72e775/header_schinese.jpg?t=1790830287","website":"https://15industry.co.jp/wordpress/wdc/","developers":["ジギタリス出版"],"publishers":["15 Industry"],"release_date":"2026 年 7 月 8 日","coming_soon":false,"supported_languages":"英语, 简体中文, 日语<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","可以仅用鼠标","#category_playable_at_your_own_pace","无需应对快速反应事件","随时保存","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["冒险","独立","角色扮演"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/c3019743e0810c9f5a117eae6d21346996f4e9d1/ss_c3019743e0810c9f5a117eae6d21346996f4e9d1.600x338.jpg?t=1790830287","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/c3019743e0810c9f5a117eae6d21346996f4e9d1/ss_c3019743e0810c9f5a117eae6d21346996f4e9d1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790830287"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/6ac562516837c62b8c005e325d6669b669687037/ss_6ac562516837c62b8c005e325d6669b669687037.600x338.jpg?t=1790830287","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/6ac562516837c62b8c005e325d6669b669687037/ss_6ac562516837c62b8c005e325d6669b669687037.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790830287"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/e04ed2655eaad2b9099797f56089e412abc2db9a/ss_e04ed2655eaad2b9099797f56089e412abc2db9a.600x338.jpg?t=1790830287","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/e04ed2655eaad2b9099797f56089e412abc2db9a/ss_e04ed2655eaad2b9099797f56089e412abc2db9a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790830287"}],"price":{"currency":"JPY","initial":"1980.00","final":"1584.00","discount":20}}
